<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">- Projet de traduction en Gbaya</book>
  <para style="h">ESTHER</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ɛst</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɛstɛr</para>
  <para style="toc1">Takarata pɛ Ɛstɛr</para>
  <para style="mt2">Takarata pɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Esther</para>
  <para style="is">Bebe wen hazu takarata pɛ Esther</para>
  <para style="ip">Takarata pɛ Esther osi nɛ kasiwen pɛ zɔnga bhoko Zuif ka haa tunɔ pɛa mɔ kpasisi nɛ kandɔ pɛa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kasiwen ɛngɛ angiri ha ngimɔ dungɔ hazu solo wan pɛ Assierus, kongapora mɔ Perse. Sulo hio Zuif fɛt nduko ha zang le pɛ mbwa, maa hio ma bhɔna ha zang le mɔ Perse (kongakandɔ ka ba ganzu hio wi mɔ le Babilone). Kongapora gɔna soko hinɛ ko pɛa nɛ a sio may hinɛ Esther, nɛ dede lɔka bebhoko Zuif. Ha ngimɔ ɛngi bosi gɔvɔrɔma, Haman, dea ma gdungi mɔ bhɔdisi hio Zuif. Yang mɛ Esther, Mardose, ha kpa goto gdungi nɛ mɔsoykisi, Mardose nɛ Esther kpa wal mɔ kpasisi kandɔ pɛ mbwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Takarata ɛngɛ tɛ ngɛrki ling Sɔ na, maa osa mɛng a haa kɔ mɔ pam nɛ kandɔ pɛa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mardose yang mɛ Esther tɔa ha wɛnɛ:</para>
  <para style="ip">«Maa o ha be ing o nde? Mɛ tɛ bo nɛ ko pɛ kongapora, ɔ ing na mana yo nɛ̂ hazu kpasisi ɔ ha zang ngaya mɔ ɛngɛ.» (4.14)</para>
  <para style="ip">Takarata ɛngɛ osa fin hio goto mɔ nɛ hio goto yenga pɛ Zuif ka ɛ sa nde «Purim».</para>
  <para style="is">Hio mɔ ngaya mɔ takarata ɛngɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Esther tɛ bonɛ ko pɛ kongapora (1.1–2.23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Haman ngoy mɔ gbɛ hio Zuif (3.1-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mardose ana haa kɔ pɛ Esther (4.1-17)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kongapora haa zio tɛ ha Mardose (5.1–6.14)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛ gbɛa Haman (7.1-10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hio Zuif gbɛa hio ngana pɛ mbwa (8.1–9.19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛ dea yenga mɔ Purim (9.20-32)</para>
  <para style="io1">Assierus nɛ Mardose tɛ bonɛ ngaya (10.1-3)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EST 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yenga yɔngamɔ pɛ kongapora Assierus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 1:1" />Kasiwen ɛngɛ bahɔ ha ngimɔ pɛ Assierus. Wɛnɛ badung nɛ̂ kongapora ha zu hio kandɔnu gɔmmay ndang nɛ bhuzebwa zanga mɔrkɔ gbala bwa (127), angiri ha Inde gbo ha Etiopi. <verse eid="EST 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 1:2" />Ha ngimɔ ɛngi, kongapora Assierus dungɔ ha zu solowan pɛa ha zang kin, ha le Suze. <verse eid="EST 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 1:3" />Ha zetar bɛlɛ ka wɛnɛ dungɔ nɛ̂ kongapora, a dungɔ ha zu ma fada ka wɛnɛ haa ha hio gasa wi mɔ zu tom pɛa hinɛ hio wantom pɛa, ha zugili hio wan-bibulo mɔ Perse hinɛ Medi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Medi: Ling ɛngɛ osi nɛ̂ hio wi mɔ kongakandɔ mɔ Perse fɛt.</char></note>, ha hio zio wi hinɛ hio gasa wi mɔ gɔvɔrɔma mɔ hio kandɔnu. <verse eid="EST 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 1:4" />Wɛnɛ osa ha hio wi ndɔng fɛt long hio lɛkɛ lɛkɛ kpaamɔ nɛ hio dede mɔ fɛt ka ɛ lɛm kpaa ha ma bhandi na, nɛ ka de ngaya mɔ kongakandɔ pɛa. Yenga yɔngamɔ ɛngi baa ngimɔ nɛ dɔka, fioze mɔrkɔ zanga ndang. <verse eid="EST 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 1:5" />Ha kpogio yala mɔ yenga ɛngi, kongapora haa ma gasa yɔngamɔ mɔ yala mɔrkɔ zanga bwa ha zang dɛl kin mɔ kongapora pɛa ka ɛ gunɔ hio te ang, ha hio wi fɛt ka badung ha le Suze, angiri ha tɛ hio wan kpamɔ gbo ha tɛ hio fabha wi. <verse eid="EST 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 1:6" />Ɛ bhɔngara zang kina nɛ hio dede bu la mɔ lɛn hinɛ hio bumɔ tɛ hio sami ka dafua lɛma may nɛ lîswe. Ɛ sanga yo ha ngɔn nɛ pɛl la ka dung nɛ gbɛa. Ɛ sanga yo ha tɛ mbanzia ka ɛ dea nɛ bolo mboli nɛ ɛ sanga yo ha tɛ hio nzɔng gasa te twa ka ɛ dea nɛ ta mɔ marbrɛ. Ɛ dea hio dede gasa kiti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kiti: Ha ngimɔ ɛngi, hio wi yɔngmɔ ha zu hio yala ka ɛ pɛsɛ ha nu.</char></note> ka ɛ yɛfifi tɛ ang yɔng nɛ mɔ, ka ɛ dea nɛ ɔr hinɛ hio wi mɔ bolo mboli. Nu zang kina nɛ hio ta ka dung nɛ gbɛa, hio ma nɛ bua, hio ma ha duo we, nɛ hio ma nɛ tua. <verse eid="EST 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 1:7" />Ɛ kapana dɔkɔ ha hio wia ha zang hio kɔpɔ nɛtɛ nɛtɛ ka ɛ doya nɛ ɔr. Gbɛ lî dɔkɔ pɛ kongapora ha sɛa tuka li ka ɛ ku ha hio wi lɛm nɛ dede sila pɛ kongapora. <verse eid="EST 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 1:8" />Wi ndang ndang nɔ mɔ tuka sila wa ngoya, bo nɛ wal nɔsasamɔ na. Kongapora haa nû nɛ ngaya ha hio wantom mɔ twa pɛa, mɔ de ɔ lɛm nɛ hɛl sila wi ndang ndang. <verse eid="EST 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 1:9" />Ko pɛ kongapora, Vasti, nɛ bhalkɔa, haa ma fada ha hio bhoko ha zang kin pɛ kongapora Assierus.<verse eid="EST 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kongapora pensa ko pɛa Vasti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 1:10" />Ha yala mɔrkɔ zanga bwa mɔ yenga ɛngi, ha zang totɛ nɔa gbɛlî dɔkɔ, Assierus tɔa ha hio napam wɛnɛ mɔrkɔ zanga bwa tuka: Mehuman, Bizta, Harbona, Bigta, Abagta, Zetar banɛ Karkas ka ɛ gba mbwa nɛ mala, nɛ ka dung gdunge gdunge ha pɛtɛ wa, <verse eid="EST 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 1:11" />mɔ nɛ̂ nɛ ku Vasti tɛ̂ nɛ̂ ha lî kongapora, nɛ ndutu kongapora pɛa fɛt, hazu osi lɔkatɛ wa ha lî hio wi gasa hinɛ hio wi ka ɛ saa fin, hazu wɛnɛ dungɔ nɛ tɛ̂ lɔka pentɛ. <verse eid="EST 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 1:12" />Maa, Vasti kafa tɛa ha haanû pɛ kongapora ka wɛnɛ tomsa nɛ wal hio wei mala ndɔng. Kongapora zɔka nde Vasti fingsa ɛ. Mɛgi, a dea ngambi nɛ gdanga. <verse eid="EST 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 1:13" />Kongapora zea may hinɛ hio wan-mbarimɔ. Hazu hio wen zang kin pɛ kongapora fɛt, ɛ bhɔngiri yo ka hinɛ hio wi ka ingɔ mɔ ha zu mbonga banɛ hio ndɔkitɛ mɔ le nɛ ka tɛ̂ sanga nɛ wɛnɛ: <verse eid="EST 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 1:14" />Kasena, Setar, Admata, Tarsis, Meres, Marsena, hinɛ Memukan nɛ̂ hio gasa wi mɔrkɔ zanga bwa pɛ kongapora mɔ le Perse hinɛ Medi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zɔk Esther 1.2-3 .</char></note> Kongapora, nɛ ka mbwa dung ha hio bosi bhandi ha zang kongakandɔ. <verse eid="EST 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 1:15" />Kongapora tɔa ha mbwa nde:« ngetɛ mbonga ha lɛm nɛ tili deamɔ ɛngɛ ka Vasti dea kafi nɛ haanû pɛ kongapora nɛ wal hio wei mala ndɔng ge nde?»<verse eid="EST 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 1:16" />Memukan tɔa wen ha lî kongapora hinɛ hio gasa wi mɔ si wa : «Gdanga deamɔ pɛ Vasti bo Sɔna sungiri nɛ kongapora na, maa yo nɛ̂ sungiri hio gasa wi mɔ si wa fɛt banɛ hio wi fɛt ha zang hio kandɔnu pɛ kongapora, Assierus. <verse eid="EST 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 1:17" />Hazu, ka hio bhoko fɛt be ing wen kafamɔ pɛ Vasti ha haa nû pɛ kongapora Assierus, mbwa be angiri bhesara hio wei pɛ mbwa, ka ɛ beba kasia ha mbwa nde kongapora Assierus haa nû nde, ɛ ku ko pɛa tɛ̂ nɛ̂ ha lî wa, nɛ Vasti kafa nɛ̂a. <verse eid="EST 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 1:18" />Sising, hio bhoko mɔ Perse hinɛ mɔ Medi beze wen kafa haanû pɛ ko pɛ kongapora ɛngɛ, mbwa betɔ ndangtɛ wen mɔsoykisi ha tɛ hio wei pɛ mbwa fɛt. Mɛgi, hio bhoko lɛm zisi hio wei pɛ mbwa na, nɛ sila hio wei pɛ mbwa beyim sungiri mbwa. <verse eid="EST 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 1:19" />Ka sila Kongapora ngoya, ɛ begbasi wen ka kongapora tɔa, ka ɛ kpalsi na, nɛ ka ɛ gdea ha zang hio mbonga mɔ Perse hinɛ Medi nde Vasti lɛm tɛ fin ha lî kongapora Assierus na. Nɛ kongapora be ha ziomɔ mɔ kongakandɔ pɛa ha ma Sɔy danwa bhoko ka dung nɛ dedea pen wɛnɛ. <verse eid="EST 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 1:20" />Ka hio wi fɛt ha zang kongakandɔ pɛ mɛ, be ing zio wen gɔnanû ɛngɛ, hio bhoko fɛt bezisi hio wei pɛ mbwa, angiri ha wan kpamɔ gbo ha tɛ hio fabha wi.»<verse eid="EST 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 1:21" />Gbasamɔ ɛngɛ baa sila kongapora hinɛ hio wi ka mbwa saa, nɛ kongapora dea mɔ lɛm nɛ wen ka Memukan batɔ. <verse eid="EST 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 1:22" />A tomsa hio takarata ha zang hio kandɔnu pɛa fɛt, nɛ ɛ ngɛraka takarataa ha zang kandɔnu ndang ndang fɛt nɛ wal ngɛraka mɔ pɛa nɛ nû lea. Nɛ kandɔ ndang ndang nɛ nûle pɛa tuka nde hio wei ndang ndang fɛt ka dung wan ha twa pɛa, nɛ wɛnɛ atɔ wen nɛ nûle pɛa.<verse eid="EST 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EST 2" />
  <para style="s1">Esther tɛ bo nɛ̂ ko pɛ kongapora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 2:1" />Ha pata hio wi mɔ ndɔng, ngambi pɛ kongapora Assierus gaa. Tazu wa gbaa nɛ Vasti nɛ mɔ ka wɛnɛ bade, hinɛ gɔnanû ka ɛ ba baa sungiri nɛ Vasti. <verse eid="EST 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 2:2" />Hio pɔlɔmbɔ wi ka de tom ha si kongapora tɔa: «Lɛma nde ɔ aki ha kongapora pɛ ɔ, hio zɔnga bhoko ka tɛ ing wei na, nɛ ka lɔka pentɛ. <verse eid="EST 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 2:3" />Yo nɛ dedea nde kongapora aha nû ha hio wan-nɛ̂tom mɔ zang hio kandɔnu mɔ kongakandɔ pɛa, mɔ wesiri hio zɔnga bhoko ka dung nɛ lɔka nɛ ka tɛ ing wei na, mɔ le pɛ mbwa fɛt ha zang twa pɛ hio bhoko mɔ kin pɛ kongapora ha Suze. Yo nɛ̂ Hege, napam hio ko pɛ kongapora ha bezɔk mɔ ha zu mbwa, nɛ yo nɛ wɛnɛ ha beha hio wi mɔ de zɔnga pɛ mbwa ha mbwa. <verse eid="EST 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 2:4" />Zɔnga bhoko ɛngi ka beba sila kongapora pentɛ, beba bhandi pɛ Vasti.» Wena ba sila kongapora, mɛgi, ɛ dea mɔa lɛm nɛ yo.<verse eid="EST 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 2:5" />Ha zang le Suze, ma wei ka dung nɛ̂ Zuif ang, ling wa nɛ̂ Mardose bewei pɛ Yair, Yair nɛ̂ bewei pɛ Simei, nɛ Simei bewei pɛ Kis, mɔ kandɔ pɛ Benzamin. <verse eid="EST 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 2:6" />Ɛ baku wɛnɛ ha Zerusalɛm tɛ̂ nɛ̂ ha soko hio wi ndɔng ka Nebukadnetsar, kongapora mɔ Babylone kaya nɛ mbwa tɛ̂ nɛ̂ mɔsoykisi hinɛ Yekonia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yekonia, ka ɛ saa fin nde Yoakin mana Konia dungɔ kongapora mɔ Zuda kanɛ fioze tar Sɔna ha bɛlɛ 597 Sɔngsi nɛ Zesus Krist. Zɔk 2 Hio Kongapora 24.8-16.</char></note> kongapora mɔ Zuda. <verse eid="EST 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 2:7" />Tangere, Mardose dungɔ nɛ̂ napam Hadassa ka ɛ sa fin nde Esther. Wɛnɛ dungɔ nɛ bebhoko pɛ ya mɛ bafa mɛ Mardose mɔ wei. Esther nɛ̂ ma bebhoko ka bafa hinɛ nana, mbwa bwa fɛt Fea. Nɛ bebhoko ɛngɛ dungɔ nɛ lɔka pentɛ. Ha pata fio pɛ bafa wa hinɛ nana wa, yo nɛ̂ Mardose ka pam wɛnɛ.<verse eid="EST 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 2:8" />Ka ɛ hea nɛ mbela haanû hinɛ mbonga pɛ kongapora, ɛ wesara hio dɔka zɔnga bhoko tɛ̂ nɛ̂ ha le Suze ha si Hegai. Mɛgi, ɛ kuo Esther tɛ̂ nɛ̂ ha zang kin pɛ kongapora, ha si Hegai, napam hio bhoko. <verse eid="EST 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 2:9" />Wen pɛ Esther baa sila Hegai pentɛ, nɛ wɛnɛ dea dede sila ha tɛ wa. Nɛ hasa, Hegai haa hio wi mɔ ka lɛma mɔ de zɔnga pɛa ha wɛnɛ, nɛ mɔ yɔng, hinɛ hio ma bebhoko tom mɔrkɔ zanga bwa mɔ zang kin ka ɛ sala mbwa mɔ de tom ha Esther. Hegai kuo Esther hinɛ hio bhoko ndɔng, nɛ gde mbwa ha zang ma dede pimbi mɔ twa pɛ bhoko. <verse eid="EST 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 2:10" />Esther tɛ gbasi hio nam pɛa hinɛ kandɔ pɛa ha ma wi ndang na, hazu Mardose badol wɛnɛ mɔ gbasi yo ha hio wi. <verse eid="EST 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 2:11" />Mardose ha yala swe fɛt, zikiri twa pɛ hio bhoko mɔ ing nɛ dungɔnu pɛ Esther, nɛ mɔ ka ɛ de ha tɛ wa.<verse eid="EST 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 2:12" />Ngimɔ pɛ hio zɔnga bhoko ndang ndang mɔ nɛ̂ ha pɛ kongapora Assierus hɔa ha kpogio hio fioze bhukɔ gbala bwa, lɛm nɛ mɔ ka napam mbwa bhɔngara, hazu ngimɔ dea zɔnga pɛ mbwa ka ɛ haa, kara: Ha zang ze mɔrkɔ zanga ndang, mbwa ha pɛla nɔ mɔ myre, nɛ ha zang hio olo ze mɔrkɔ zanga ndang, mbwa pɛla liyama mɔ aromate hinɛ hio ma dede mɔ de zɔnga pɛ hio bhoko. <verse eid="EST 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 2:13" />Ha ngimɔ ka ma zɔnga bhoko nɛ̂ ha pɛ kongapora, mɔ fɛt ka wɛnɛ ani, ɛ haa yo ha wɛnɛ ha twa pɛ hio bhoko, nɛ̂ nɛ̂ ha kin pɛ kongapora. <verse eid="EST 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 2:14" />Nɛ mbolo, bhoko ndang nɛa ha zang twa pɛ kongapora, nɛ mɔsaa nɛ sutole, wɛnɛ lea ma mbing twa pɛ hio bhoko nɛtɛ fin, mɔ dung ha si Sasgaz, napam hio wanza pɛ kongapora. A lɛm mɔ nduki fin ha pɛ kongapora na, ka kongapora tɛ de hɛl tɛ wa, nɛ sa wɛnɛ nɛ ling na.<verse eid="EST 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 2:15" />Ka ngimɔ pɛa mɔ nɛ̂ ha pɛ kongapora hɔa, Esther, bebhoko pɛ Abisail, ya mɛ bafa mɛ Mardose napam wɛnɛ, tɛ ani fin ma mɔ nɛtɛ pen mɔ ka Hegai, napam hio bhoko pɛ kongapora baosi ha wɛnɛ na. Hio wi fɛt ka zɔk Esther, mbwa ha lukoso wɛnɛ. <verse eid="EST 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 2:16" />Ɛ tɛa tɛ ku Esther nɛ nɛ̂ ha pɛ kongapora, Assierus, ha bhukɔ zea ka dung nɛ̂ ze Tebet, ha mɔrkɔ zanga bwa bɛlɛ mɔ konga pɛa. <verse eid="EST 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 2:17" />Kongapora ngoya Esther pen hio olo zɔnga bhoko ndɔng fɛt, nɛ wɛnɛ dea dede sila ha tɛ wa pen hio olo zɔnga bhoko fɛt ka tɛ ing wei na. Mɛgi, a gdea ndutu kongapora ha zu Esther, nɛ a gdea wɛnɛ ha bhandi pɛ Vasti. <verse eid="EST 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 2:18" />Kongapora haa ma gasa fada ha hio gasa wi mɔ si wa hinɛ hio wantom pɛa fɛt, ha wen zu Esther. Kongapora haa nû nde ɛ futi garama fin na, nɛ a kapana hio wi mɔ ha hio wi nɛ mɔsoykilea.<verse eid="EST 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 2:19" />Ka ɛ wesara hio zɔnga bhoko fin mɔ zebwaa, Mardose tɛ bo nɛ ma tom ha nû kin pɛ kongapora. <verse eid="EST 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 2:20" />Esther tɛ̂ gbasi hio nam pɛa hinɛ kandɔ pɛa ha hio wi na, tuka Mardose baha nɛ nû ha wɛnɛ. Esther dea mɔ lɛm nɛ hio haanû pɛ Mardose, ka wɛnɛ badung ha dea ha ngimɔ ka wɛnɛ bhɔna ha si Mardose.<verse eid="EST 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mardose zea ma gdanga dambari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 2:21" />Ha ngimɔ ɛngi, Mardose dungɔ ha bhandi tom pɛa ha nû kin pɛ kongapora. Hio ma napam kin pɛ kongapora, ka pam nûtwa pɛ kongapora ha dɛl: Bigtan hinɛ Teres, nɛ wal gasa ngambi pɛ mbwa, zea may mɔ de gdangamɔ ha tɛ kongapora, Assierus. <verse eid="EST 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 2:22" />Mardose zea wena, nɛ a tɔa pataa ha Esther, ko pɛ kongapora. Esther tɔa pata wena ha kongapora nɛ ling Mardose. <verse eid="EST 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 2:23" />Ɛ kio pata wena, nɛ ɛ kpaa nde yo nɛ̂ kpasawen: Ɛ gɛsa hio wantom ndɔng bwa fɛt ha te. Ɛ ngɛraka wen ɛngi ha zang takarata kasiwen mɔ kongakandɔ, ha lî kongapora.<verse eid="EST 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EST 3" />
  <para style="s1">Haman hinɛ Mardose tɛ bo nɛ̂ hio ngana ha soko may</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 3:1" />Ha pata hio wi mɔ ndɔng, kongapora Assierus haa ziomɔ pentɛ ha Haman, bewei pɛ Hammedata, mɔ nam pɛ Agag<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Agag badung se kongapora mɔ Amalɛk, tɛ̂ gasa ngana pɛ kongapora Saul. Zɔk 1 Samuel 15.</char></note>. Kongapora gdea wɛnɛ tuka bosi gasa wi mɔ gɔvɔrɔma pɛa ha zu hio olo bewan fɛt. <verse eid="EST 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 3:2" />Hio wantom pɛ kongapora fɛt ka de tom ha nû kin, ha hilo nɛ gɔm zu ha si Haman hazu haa ziomɔ ha wɛnɛ. Kongapora ba haa nû mɛgi. Tangere, Mardose tɛ̂ hil nɛ gɔm zu wa ha si Haman na. <verse eid="EST 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 3:3" />Hio wantom pɛ kongapora fɛt ka dung ha nû kin, tɔa ha Mardose nde: «Ha wen ge mɛ pen nɛtɛ ha haanû pɛ kongapora ge nde?» <verse eid="EST 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 3:4" />A kiforo wen ha mbwa nde ɛ nɛ̂ Zuif. Mɛgi mbwa dungɔ ha ana wɛnɛ yala ndang ndang ha wena, maa, a ze mbwa na. Mɛgi, mbwa tɔa pata wena ha Haman, mɔ zɔk mana Mardose ka batɔ ha mbwa nde ɛ nɛ̂ Zuif, bebhɔn ha zu deamɔ pɛa nde? <verse eid="EST 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 3:5" />Haman zɔka nde Mardose tɛ̂ hil nɛ gɔm zu ha si wa hazu haa ziomɔ ha wɛnɛ na, nɛ gasa ngambi dea Haman pentɛ. <verse eid="EST 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 3:6" />A tɛ̂ zɔk nɛ dedea mɔ de gdangamɔ ha tɛ Mardose gbatɛ na, nɛ ɛ gbasa ha wɛnɛ kandɔ pɛ Mardose. Mɛgi Haman kio wal mɔ bhondisi hio Zuif ka dung nɛ̂ hio wi pɛ Mardose ha zang kongakandɔ pɛ Assierus fɛt. <verse eid="EST 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 3:7" />Ha bosi ze ka ɛ sa nde Nisan, ha bhukɔ gbala bwa bɛlɛ mɔ konga pɛ Assierus, ɛ gɔsa ha lî Haman, ma mɔ nde pur ka dung tuka zeke, ha zu yala ndang ndang mɔ hio ze bhukɔ gbala bwa mɔ bɛlɛ ndang. Nɛ zekea osa bhukɔ gbala bwa ze ka ɛ sa nde Adar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ze Adar: Yo ha soko ze Mbangbhɛlɛ hinɛ Hulewagia (Mars-Avril).</char></note>.<verse eid="EST 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haman bheka mɔ gbɛ hio Zuif</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 3:8" />Haman tɔa ha kongapora Assierus: «Ma kandɔ ang nɛtɛ. Mbwa ha bhandi fɛt, mbwa lea ha soko hio kandɔ fɛt ha zang konga kandɔ mɔ kandɔ pɛ mɛ. Hio mbonga pɛ mbwa gbaa soko mbwa nɛ hio olo kandɔ fɛt. Nɛ mbwa ngoy dea mɔ lɛm nɛ pata hio mbonga pɛ kongapora na. Lɛm nde kongapora a gde mbwa mɛgi na. <verse eid="EST 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 3:9" />Kongapora, mɛ gde kɔ̂ ha si ma mbonga ka ha wal ha ɔ mɔ gbɛ mbwa fɛt, nɛ mi begɛsi zio bolo mbɔli ka lɛm nɛ mɔ gɛsimɔ kilo tomay gɔmmay tar (300 000) gde ha kɔ̂ hio wan-pammboli mɔ gɔvɔrɔma, hazu gɔsi yo ha zang kubha mbɔli pɛ kongapora.» <verse eid="EST 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 3:10" />Kongapora kpɔsa konga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Konga: Yo nɛ̂ mɔ ndɔngkɔ̂ ka osi ngaya pɛ kongapora. Nɛ wi ka yol yo lɛma deamɔ ha bhandi nû kongapora. </char></note> pɛa ha bhanzakɔ̂ wa yu nɛ̂, nɛ ha yo ha Haman ngana pɛ hio Zuif, bewei pɛ Hammedata, mɔ nam pɛ Agag. <verse eid="EST 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 3:11" />Kongapora tɔa ha Haman nde: «Mbɔlia abhɔn ha kɔ̂ mɛ, mɔsoykisi nɛ kandɔ ɛngi, mɛ de mɔ ka sila mɛ ngoya ha tɛ mbwa!»<verse eid="EST 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 3:12" />Ɛ saa hio wan-ngɛrikimɔ pɛ kongapora fɛt ha yala bhukɔ gbala tar mɔ bosi ze. Ɛ ngɛraka hio haanû pɛ Haman fɛt ha ma takarata ha hio kɔmanda pɛ kongapora, ha hio gasa wi mɔ gɔvɔrɔma mɔ hio kandɔnu ndang ndang, hinɛ hio bewan mɔ kandɔ ndang ndang, ha kandɔnu ndang ndang ha zang ngɛrakamɔ pɛa, nɛ hio kandɔ ndang ndang ha zang nûle pɛa. Ɛ ngɛraka yo nɛ ling kongapora Assierus, nɛ Haman gdea dafu kɔ̂ kongapora ha tɛa nɛ wal konga ka wɛnɛ yola ha bhanzakɔ̂ wa. <verse eid="EST 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 3:13" />Ɛ tomsa hio ngɛrakamɔ ndɔng ha kɔ̂ hio wan-nɛ̂tom mɔ kapini yo ha zang hio kandɔnu pɛ kongapora fɛt: Dungɔ nde ɛ bhondisi, ɛ gbɛ nɛ ɛ bisi hio Zuif fɛt yu nɛ̂ angiri ha hio pɔlɔmbɔ wi gbo ha tɛ hio gbɛla wi, hio bhobem tuka hio bhoko, ha zang ma yala ndang, ha yala bhukɔ gbala tar, mɔ bhukɔ gbala bwa zea, ka dung nɛ̂ ze Adar. Ɛ lɛma kaya hio wi mɔ pɛ mbwa nɛ ngambanzi. <verse eid="EST 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 3:14" />Takarata ka gbasi mbonga ɛngi, ɛ tomsa yo ndang ndang ha zang hio kandɔnua fɛt. Ɛ tɔl yo ha hio wi mɔ le fɛt kade mbwa adung sanga ha yala ka ɛ osa. <verse eid="EST 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 3:15" />Hio wan nɛ̂ tom pena nɛ hasa, ha si nga wen nû kongapora, nɛ ɛ tɔla mbonga ɛngɛ ha hio wi mɔ le Suze. Kongapora hinɛ Haman dungɔ nu ha nɔa mɔ pɛ mbwa. Maa, zu hio wi mɔ le Suze tɛ bo yembele yembele.<verse eid="EST 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EST 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mardose ana Esther mɔ al nû ha kongapora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 4:1" />Ka Mardose zea wen mɔ ndɔng fɛt ka hɔa, a gbaa hio latɛ wa yu nɛ̂ a tɛ wa, wɛnɛ yola la-zimmɔ, a aa bokwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔanu ha zu bokwe, hinɛ aa bokwe ha zu, osi nɛ̂ gasa ngɔtɛ.</char></note> ha zu wa, nɛ wɛnɛ nɛa nɛ yo ha zang le. A gdɔra nɛ ngaya nɛ ngɔtɛ. <verse eid="EST 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 4:2" />Mɛgi, a hɔa ha nû kin pɛ kongapora, a yola, hazu yo dungɔ nɛ ngaya nde ma wi ale ha kin pɛ kongapora nɛ la zim-mɔ. <verse eid="EST 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 4:3" />Ha zang hio kandɔnua ndang ndang, ha bhandi fɛt ka haanû pɛ kongapora hɔa ang, hio Zuif tɛ bo nɛ gasa ngɔtɛ: Mbwa ha zimɔ yɔngamɔ, mbwa ha hea kwa, nɛ mbwa ha lokatɛ, hio ma nɛ dɔka ha ɔa nu ha zu hio la-zimmɔ nɛ ha zang bokwe.<verse eid="EST 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 4:4" />Hio bhoko wantom pɛ Esther hinɛ hio wei ka ɛ gbaa mbwa nɛ mala tɛa tɛ tɔ pata hio wi mɔ ka mbwa zɔka nɛ sila Esther bhunzoko. A tomsa hio ma la ha Mardose mɔ tɔ nde wɛnɛ ha kpɔsi yol ha bhandi la mɔ zimmɔ ka yo ha tɛ wa. Maa, Mardose kafa. <verse eid="EST 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 4:5" />Mɛgi, Esther saa Hatak, ma ndang ha soko hio wei mala ka kongapora sala mɔ de tom ha si Esther. Wɛnɛ haa nû ha Hatak ha zu Mardose, mɔ ing mɔ ka hɔa, nɛ goto wena nɛ ge mɔ ka ngbɔsi Mardose ha deamɔ ɛngi. <verse eid="EST 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 4:6" />Hatak gboa nɛ kpa may hinɛ Mardose ha gasa bhandi kpamay ka zɔk may hinɛ kin pɛ kongapora. <verse eid="EST 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 4:7" />Mardose kiforo pata wen hio wi mɔ ka hɔa ha wɛnɛ, nɛ hio wen mbɔli fɛt ka Haman gɔna nû mɔ gɔsi ha zang hio kubha mbɔli pɛ kongapora hazu bhondisi nɛ hio Zuif. <verse eid="EST 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 4:8" />A haa fin ma takarata mɔ mbonga ka ɛ gbasa ha Suze ha Hatak, nɛ ka ha nû mɔ bhondisi hio Zuif. Mardose tɔa ha Hatak mɔ osi yo ha Esther, mɔ kifiri pata wena fin ha wɛnɛ, nɛ mɔ ha nû ha wɛnɛ mɔ nɛ̂ ha pɛ kongapora hazu ani dede sila nɛ al nû ha wɛnɛ hazu kandɔ pɛa. <verse eid="EST 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 4:9" />Hatak tɛa tɛ tɔ ha Esther pata wen fɛt ka Mardose tɔa ha wɛnɛ. <verse eid="EST 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 4:10" />Esther tɔa ha Hatak, nɛ wɛnɛ haa nû ha wɛnɛ nde wɛnɛ atɔ ha Mardose: <verse eid="EST 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 4:11" />«Hio wantom pɛ kongapora fɛt, nɛ hio wi mɔ kandɔnu pɛa fɛt ingɔ nde, hio wi fɛt, wei mana bhoko, ka le ha zang kin pɛ kongapora, ka ɛ tɛ̂ sa wɛnɛ na, ɛ begbɛ wɛnɛ lɛm nɛ ma mbonga ka dung ha zu wi fɛt. Wi ka bebhɔn nɛ zutunɔ, bedung Sɔna nɛ̂ wi ɛngɛ ka kongapora beyɛfifi tongolo pɛa mɔ ɔr ha tɛ wa. Maa, pɔm, dea yala bhukɔa tar ka ɛ tɛ̂ sa mi fin mɔ nɛ̂ ha pɛ kongapora na.» <verse eid="EST 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 4:12" />Ɛ tɔa pata wen nû Esther ha Mardose. <verse eid="EST 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 4:13" />Mardose kiforo wen ha Esther: «Mɛ takiri pɛ mɛ nde, mɛ ndang Sɔna bekpɔy ha soko hio Zuif fɛt hazu mɛ ha zang twa pɛ kongapora nde? <verse eid="EST 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 4:14" />Ka mɛ bhɔna ha dungɔ sɛm ha mɔ ɛngɛ, gaamɔ hinɛ kpasi pɛ hio Zuif betɛ nɛ ma wal nɛtɛ? Way, mɛ hinɛ nam pɛ mɛ, ɛnɛ befe. Maa o ha be ing o nde? Mɛ tɛ bo nɛ̂ ko pɛ kongapora, ɔ ing na mana yo nɛ̂ hazu kpasisi ɔ ha zang ngamɔ ɛngɛ.» <verse eid="EST 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 4:15" />Mɛgi, Esther kiforo wen ha Mardose nde: <verse eid="EST 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 4:16" />«Mɛ nɛ̂, nɛ wesiri hio Zuif fɛt ka dung ha le Suze. Ɛnɛ zim yɔngamɔ nɛ ɛnɛ gɔ Sɔ ha wen zu mi, ɛnɛ yɔng mɔ nɛ nɔ mɔ na, swe nɛ zɛ, kanɛ̂ yala tar. Mi fin, mi bezim mɔ mɔsoykisi hinɛ hio bebhoko wantom pɔm. Hapata hio wi mɔ ndɔng, mi benɛ ha pɛ kongapora ngase mbonga ang ka gdɔki wal mɔ nɛ ha pɛ kongapora nɛ tum. Ka yo nɛ nde mi afe, mi befe! <verse eid="EST 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 4:17" />Tuka ɛngi Mardose pena nɛ de mɔ ka Esther haanû ha wɛnɛ mɔ de.<verse eid="EST 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EST 5" />
  <para style="s1">Esther nɛa ha pɛ kongapora.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 5:1" />Ka yala tar mɔ zimomɔa kara, Esther yola la pɛa mɔ ko pɛ kongapora, nɛ a nɛa ha lîdɛl mɔ kin pɛ kongapora, ha nûtwa pɛ kongapora. Kongapora ha dungɔ ha zu solowan pɛa ha zang kin ka zɔk may nɛ nûtwaa. <verse eid="EST 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 5:2" />Ka wɛnɛ zɔka ko pɛa ha lîdɛl, a zɔka wɛnɛ nɛ dede sila. Mɛgi, kongapora yɛfafa tongolo pɛa mɔ ɔr<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tongolo ɔr: Zɔk fin Esther 4:11.</char></note> ka dung ha kɔ̂ wa ha Esther. Esther tiko sanga, nɛ wɛnɛ ndɔa ndɔng tongoloa.<verse eid="EST 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 5:3" />Kongapora tɔa ha wɛnɛ nde: «Nɛ̂ ge Esther, ko pɛ kongapora? Mɛ ani nɛ̂ ge? Ngase yo adung nɛ̂ kongakandɔ pɔm ka ɛ lɛma gba sokoa ha binsila mɔ ha bhalkɔa ha mɛ, ɛ beha.» <verse eid="EST 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 5:4" />Esther kiforo wen ha wɛnɛ nde: «Ka mɛ ngoya, kongapora pɔm, mɛ tɛ ha pɔm hinɛ Haman ha ma gasa yɔngamɔ ka mi bhɔngara ha wen zu mɛ.»<verse eid="EST 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 5:5" />Kongapora tɔa ha hio ma wantom pɛa: «Ɛnɛ nɛ̂ nɛ hasa, nɛ tɔ ha Haman mɔ kifiri wen ha saa sala pɛ Esther.» Kongapora hinɛ Haman tɛa ha gasa yɔngamɔ ka Esther bhɔngara. <verse eid="EST 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 5:6" />Hapata yɔngamɔa, kongapora tɔa ha Esther: «Mɛ ani nɛ̂ ge nde? Ɛ beha yo ha mɛ. Mɔ ka mɛ ngɔy nɛ̂ ge? Ngase yo adung nɛ̂ kongakandɔ pɔm ka ɛ lɛma gbaa sokoa ha binsila mɔ ha bhalkɔa ha mɛ, ɛ beha.» <verse eid="EST 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 5:7" />Esther kiforo wen nde: «Mɔ ka mi ngoya nɛ mɔ ka mi ani nɛ̂: <verse eid="EST 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 5:8" />«Ka mi kpa dede sila pɛ kongapora pɔm, ka kongapora ngoy mɔ ha mɔ ka mi ana ha mi, nɛ mɔ ka mi ngoy: Lɛma nde kongapora atɛ̂ hinɛ Haman ha gasa yɔngamɔ ka mi bebhɔngiri ha mbwa bhisiri, nɛ mi bekirifi wen long ha kongapora.»<verse eid="EST 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haman bhɔngara ma sala te mɔ gɛsi Mardose ha yo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 5:9" />Haman gboa ha yala ɛngi, sila wa dona nɛ totɛ, nɛ ha zang dede dungɔnu. Hasam! Haman zɔka Mardose ha nûtwa kin pɛ kongapora. Mardose tɛ gu tɛ mɔ zisi Haman na. Mɛgi, sila Haman doya nɛ gasa ngambi sungiri nɛ Mardose. <verse eid="EST 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 5:10" />Maa, wɛnɛ baa sila nɛ a sio ha twa pɛa. A tomsa mɔ hazu sa hio dan wa ka wɛnɛ ngoy pentɛ hinɛ ko pɛa Zeres. <verse eid="EST 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 5:11" />Haman tɔa pata hio lɛkɛ-lɛkɛ kpaamɔ pɛa, hio dɔka bem pɛa, nɛ wal ka kongapora dea mɔ gde wɛnɛ nɛ zio ha zu hio gasa wi mɔ si wa nɛ hio wantom pɛ kongapora. <verse eid="EST 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 5:12" />Nɛ a tɔa ha mbwa mɔsoykisi nde: «Yo nɛ̂ mi, bonɛ ma wi nɛtɛ na, ka Esther, ko pɛ kongapora saa hinɛ kongapora ha gasa yɔngamɔ ka wɛnɛ bhɔngara. Nɛ bhisiri fin, yo nɛ̂ mi ka wɛnɛ be saa mi hinɛ kongapora. <verse eid="EST 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 5:13" />Maa, mɔ ɛngi fɛt de ma mɔ ha tɛ mi na, ka mi bhɔna ha zɔka Mardose, Zuif ɛngɛ ka de tom ha nûtwa kin pɛ kongapora.»<verse eid="EST 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 5:14" />Mɛgi Zeres, ko pɛa hinɛ hio dan wa fɛt tɔa ha wɛnɛ: «Ɛ bhɔngiri ma sala te ka kusoa lɛma mɛtɛrɛ bhuzebwa zanga mɔrkɔ. Nɛ bhisiri nɛ sutole, mɛ betɔ ha kongapora nde ɛ gɛsi Mardose ha sala tea. Mɛgi, mɛ lɛma nɛ̂ nɛ totɛ ha gasa yɔngamɔa hinɛ kongapora.» Wen ɛngi baa sila wa, nɛ a bɛa tea.<verse eid="EST 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EST 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ziomɔ ka ɛ haa ha Mardose hinɛ foe pɛ Haman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 6:1" />Ha zɛ ɛngi, la hɔ ha lî kongapora na. A ana nde ɛ ku takarata mɔ hio kasiwen mɔ bɛlɛ ndang ndang mɔ le tɛ̂ nɛ̂ ha wɛnɛ. Takarata ka ɛ ngɛraka hio gasa zuwen mɔ lea ang. Nɛ ɛ tɔla yo ha lî kongapora. <verse eid="EST 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 6:2" />Ɛ tɔla bhandi wen ka Mardose gbasa ha zu Bigtan hinɛ Ters, hio wantom bwa pɛ kongapora ka pam nûtwa kin ka kio lîwal mɔ gbɛ kongapora. <verse eid="EST 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 6:3" />Kongapora tɔa: «Ngete zio kɛamɔ ka Mardose kpaa ha dea mɔ ɛngi ge?» Hio wi ka de tom ha kongapora kiforo wen: «Ɛ tɛ̂ haa ma mɔ ndang ha wɛnɛ na.» <verse eid="EST 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 6:4" />Mɛgi, kongapora tɔa: «O ha lîdɛl o nde?» Yo dungɔ nɛ̂ Haman ka hɔa ha lîdɛl kin pɛ kongapora, hazu tɔ ha kongapora nde ɛ gɛsi Mardose ha te ka wɛnɛ bhɔngara ha zu Mardose. <verse eid="EST 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 6:5" />Hio wantom pɛ kongapora kiforo wen: «Yo nɛ̂ Haman ha yol ha lîdɛl kin.» Kongapora tɔa: «Wɛnɛ ale twa!» <verse eid="EST 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 6:6" />Haman lea twa, nɛ kongapora tɔa ha wɛnɛ: «Ɛ be de nɛ̂ ge ha ma wi ka kongapora ngoy mɔ baa wɛnɛ nɛ zio ge nde?» Haman tɔa ha zang sila wa: Ma wi ka kongapora lɛma ha ziomɔ ha wɛnɛ mɔ pen mi bona? Gan, yo ka nɛ mi!» <verse eid="EST 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 6:7" />Haman kiforo wen ha kongapora: «Kongapora ngoya baa ma wi nɛ zio? <verse eid="EST 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 6:8" />Ɛ ku ma gasa latɛ ka kongapora yola kari, nɛ ma yanga ka kongapora danga zua kari, nɛ ɛ gde ndutu konga ha zu wa. <verse eid="EST 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 6:9" />Ɛ ha gasa latɛ, mɔsoykisi nɛ yanga ka ma zio wi ndang ha soko hio gasa wantom pɛ kongapora baa. Ɛ yol laa ha wei ɛngɛ ka kongapora ngoy mɔ ba nɛ zio, ɛ ngbɔsi wɛnɛ ha zu yanga nɛ nɛ̂ ha gasa bhandi wesiri may, ɛ gbasi ha lî wa: Zɔk, ɛngɛ nɛ̂ mɔ ka ɛ de ha tɛ wi ka kongapora ngoy ba nɛ zio.<verse eid="EST 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 6:10" />Kongapora kiforo wen ha Haman: «Nɛ dedea, nɛ nɛ̂ hasa mɛ ku gasa latɛ hinɛ yangaa tuka mɛ tɔa, nɛ mɛ de mɛgi nɛ Zuif Mardose, ka dung nu ha nûtwa kin pɛ kongapora. Mɛ lakgde ma bebe mɔ ka mɛ tɔa ndang na. <verse eid="EST 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 6:11" />Haman kuo gasa latɛ yol ha tɛ Mardose, nɛ wɛnɛ kuo yangaa ngbɔsi nɛ Mardose nɛ nɛ̂ ha zang bhandi mɔ gasa bhandi wesiri may, nɛ gbasa ha lî wa: «Zɔk, ɛngɛ nɛ̂ mɔ ka ɛ de ha tɛ ma wi ka kongapora ngoy baa nɛ zio!<verse eid="EST 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 6:12" />Hapata, Mardose kiforo ha nûtwa kin pɛ kongapora, nɛ Haman hasa tɛ mɔ si ha nûtwa pɛa nɛ foe, wɛnɛ goka lî wa nɛ la mɔ wusi nɛ foe pɛa. <verse eid="EST 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 6:13" />Haman baa kasi mɔ ka hɔa ha tɛ wa ha ko pɛa Zeres, hinɛ hio dan wa fɛt, hio wan-hambɔla pɛa, hinɛ ko pɛa Zeres tɔa ha wɛnɛ: «Ka wɛnɛ nɛ̂ kandɔ Zuif, Mardose ɛngɛ ka mɛ angara teka ha si wa kari, mɛ lɛm mɔ zati ha lî wa fin na, mɛ lɛm mɔ baa liaa ha Sɔngsi wa fin na.» <verse eid="EST 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 6:14" />Ka mbwa bhɔna ha wola mɔ ha wɛnɛ, hio napam kin pɛ kongapora hɔa. Mbwa kuo Haman nɛ hasa nɛ nɛ̂ ha yɔngamɔ ka Esther bhɔngara.<verse eid="EST 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EST 7" />
  <para style="s1">Fio pɛ Haman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 7:1" />Kongapora hinɛ Haman nɛ̂a dea fada ha pɛ Esther, ko pɛ kongapora. <verse eid="EST 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 7:2" />Ha zebwa yala ɛngi fin, ha ngimɔ ka ɔ anɔa vin, kongapora tɔa ha Esther: «Mɛ ani nɛ̂ ge Esther, ko pɛ kongapora? Ɛ beha yo ha mɛ. Mɔ ka mɛ ngɔy nɛ̂ ge? Ngase yo adung nɛ̂ kongakandɔ nu pɔm mi behaa mɛ.» <verse eid="EST 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 7:3" />Esther, ko pɛ kongapora kiforo wen: «Ka mi kpa dede sila pɛ mɛ, kongapora pɔm, nɛ ka kongapora ngoya, zɔk, anamɔ pɔm nɛ̂ ɛngɛ: Mi adung nɛ zutunɔ nɛ kandɔ pɔm fin adung nɛ zutunɔ. <verse eid="EST 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 7:4" />Hazu ɛ gdonga ɔ, mi nɛ kandɔ pɔm, nde ɛ bhondisi ɔ, ɛ gbɛ ɔ, nɛ ɛ hɔn ɔ! Fin, ɛ baa gdongi ɔ, hio wei hinɛ hio bhoko, tuka hio bala, mɛgi, mi bedung sɛm, hazu badung nɛ̂ ma mɔ ka ɛ lɛma gbazu ang hinɛ kongapora na.» <verse eid="EST 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 7:5" />Kongapora Assierus kuo wen nɛ ani nɛ Esther, ko pɛa nde: «Nɛ̂ o, mana nɛ̂ ge wi ka sila wa dona nɛ hio takaramɔ ɛngi ge?» <verse eid="EST 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 7:6" />Esther kiforo wen: «Kɔmbɛ ɔ, ngana pɛ ɔ, nɛ̂ Haman, wɛnɛ nɛ̂ gdanga sila!» Mɛgi, gasa ke baa Haman ha lî kongapora nɛ ko pɛa Esther. <verse eid="EST 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 7:7" />Ngambi baa kongapora, aguotɛ ha bhandi dea fadaa, a nɛ̂a ha zang kin pɛa ha bhandi ka hio dede dote ang. Nɛ Haman bhɔna haki mɔ baa nanga Esther, ko pɛ kongapora, nde wɛnɛ akpasisi ɛ ha fio, hawenzu kongapora betɛ gbɛ wɛnɛ. <verse eid="EST 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 7:8" />Kongapora guotɛ ha zang kin ha bhandi ka dote ang, nduki ha bhandi ha bhandi fadaa, ha ngimɔ ka Haman tekala ha zang gasa kiti ka Esther yɛfafa tɛ ang. Mɛgi kongapora gdɔra: «Ha zua fin, ɛ ngoy mɔ ɔnu nɛ ko pɔm ha lî mi nɛ ngaya ha zang kin pɔm!» Ka wɛnɛ bo ka ha tɔa wena mɛgi, ɛ hɛla lî Haman.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hɛla lî: deamɔ pɛ hio wantom osi nde mbwa ze hio wen pɛ kongapora tuka ma gdea wi ha zɔbhɔ fio.</char></note> <verse eid="EST 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 7:9" />Harbona, ma ndang ha soko hio na pam kin pɛ kongapora, tɔa ha lî kongapora: «Zɔk, ma kuso te ang ka Haman bhɔngara ha pɛa ha wenzu Mardose ka tɔa dede wen pɛ kongapora. Kuso tea lɛma nɛ mɛtɛrɛ bhuzebwa zanga mɔrkɔ.» Kongapora tɔa: «Ɛ gɛsi wɛnɛ ang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esther 2.21-23.</char></note>» <verse eid="EST 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 7:10" />Ɛ gɛsa Haman ha tɛ te ka wɛnɛ bhɔngara ha wenzu Mardose. Hapata, ngambi pɛ kongapora gaa.<verse eid="EST 7:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EST 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 8:1" />Ha ndangi yala ɛngi, kongapora Assierus haa hio kpaamɔ pɛ Haman banɛ ngana pɛ hio Zuif, a haa ko pɛa Esther. Mɛgi Mardose osa tɛ wa ha Sɔngsi kongapora, hazu Esther bagbasi nde Mardose nɛ̂ nam pɛa. <verse eid="EST 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 8:2" />Mɛgi, kongapora kpɔsa konga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zɔk Esther 3.10.</char></note> ka wɛnɛ bakpɔsi ha kɔ̂ Haman yol, nɛ haa yo ha Mardose. Gbesi, Esther gdea Mardose mɔ zɔkmɔ hazu hio kpaamɔ pɛ Haman.<verse eid="EST 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kongapora haa nû ha hio Zuif mɔ pam tɛ mbwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 8:3" />Esther tɔa wen nɛ mbinga fin ha kongapora, nɛ a teka ha nanga wa. Wɛnɛ hea kwa, nɛ a baa nanga kongapora nde wɛnɛ agdɔki wal ha hio deamɔ ngasila pɛ Haman, mɔ zang nam pɛ Agag, nɛ hio wi mɔ ka wɛnɛ babhɔngiri sungiri nɛ hio Zuif. <verse eid="EST 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 8:4" />Kongapora yɛfafa tongolo mɔ ɔr<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Te mɔ ɔr: zɔk Esther 4.11.</char></note> ha Esther. Mɛgi, Esther guo tɛ nɛ yol ha Sɔngsi kongapora. <verse eid="EST 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 8:5" />Wɛnɛ tɔa: «Ka kongapora zɔka yo nɛ dedea, nɛ ka mi kpaa dede sila pɛa, ka mɔa baa sila kongapora, nɛ ka mi lɛma ha lî wa, ɛ ngɛriki ma takarata mɔ gdɔki wal ha hio takarata ka Haman, bewei pɛ Hamedata ha zang nam pɛ Agag, nɛ ka ɛ ngɛraka hazu bhondisi nɛ hio Zuif mɔ hio kandɔnu fɛt pɛ kongapora. <verse eid="EST 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 8:6" />Mɛgi, mi bede mɛng zɔk nɛ mɔ ngɔtɛ ɛngɛ ka sungiri kandɔ pɔm ge nde? Ɛy, mi bede mɛng zɔk nɛ kandɔ pɔm ha yɛmala ge nde?<verse eid="EST 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 8:7" />Kongapora Assierus tɔa ha Esther, ko pɛa nɛ Mardose mɔ zang kandɔ Zuif nde: «Zɔk, mi kuo hio kpaamɔ pɛ Haman haa ko pɔm Esther, wen zu Haman ngoya gbɛa hio Zuif pentɛ. <verse eid="EST 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 8:8" />Pɛ ɛnɛ sising, ɛnɛ ngɛriki ma takarata ka tɔ dede wen hazu hio Zuif, nɛ ɛnɛ ngɛriki ling kongapora ha zua, hazu takarata ka ling kongapora ha zua, ɛ lɛm gdɔki lîwal ha yo na.»<verse eid="EST 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 8:9" />Ɛ saa hio wan-ngɛrikimɔ pɛ kongapora ha ndangtɛ yala ɛngi, ka dung nɛ̂ yala bhuzebwa gbala tar, mɔ tar zea ka ɛ saa nde ze Sivan. Nɛ wal haanû pɛ Mardose, mbwa ngɛraka hio takarata nɛ tomsi yo ha hio Zuif, hio kɔmanda, hio gasa wi mɔ gɔvɔrɔma, hinɛ hio bewan mɔ hio kandɔnu gɔmmay ndang zubhuzebwa zanga mɔrkɔ gbala bwa (127), angiri ha le Inde gbo ha le Etiopi. Mbwa ngɛraka yo ha kandɔnu ndang ndang nɛ wal ngɛrakamɔ pɛa, nɛ hio kandɔ ndang ndang nɛ nûle pɛa; pɛ hio Zuif, ha zang ngɛrakamɔ pɛ mbwa nɛ nûle pɛ mbwa. <verse eid="EST 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 8:10" />Ɛ ngɛraka hio takarata ndɔng nɛ ling kongapora Assierus, ɛ ngɛraka ling kongapora ha zua, nɛ ɛ tomsa yo nɛ hio wan-nɛ̂tom nɛ yanga. Mbwa danga hio yanga ka Sɔwi pentɛ, ka ɛ sala ha soko yanga pɛ kongapora. <verse eid="EST 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 8:11" />Ɛ ngɛraka ha zang takarata nde: «Kongapora haa wal ha hio Zuif mɔ hio le ndang ndang mɔ wesiri may hazu pam tunɔ pɛ mbwa, hazu bhondisi, hazu gbɛ, hazu karsi ma zugili wan-bibulo mɔ le mana mɔ bebe le ka benamili mbwa hinɛ hio bhobem banɛ hio bhoko. Mbwa lɛma kay hio wi mɔ pɛ mbwa tuka mɔ pata bulo. <verse eid="EST 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 8:12" />Hio mɔ ndɔng nɛ̂ mɔ swe ndang Sɔna, ha zang hio kandɔnu fɛt pɛ kongapora Assierus, ha yala bhukɔ gbala tar mɔ ze bhukɔ gbala bwaa, ka ɛ sa nde ze Adar. <verse eid="EST 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 8:13" />Ka ngɛrakamɔa hɔa ha kandɔnu ndang ndang, dea nde hio wi mɔ kandɔnua azɔk yo tuka ma mbonga. Ɛ tɔl ha hio wi fɛt kade nde hio Zuif adung sanga ha yala ka ɛ osa mɔ kundiki hio gdangamɔ ka hio ngana pɛ mbwa bede ha tɛ mbwa. <verse eid="EST 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 8:14" />Ha pata haanû pɛ kongapora, hio wan-nɛ̂tom pɛa danga zu hio yanga ka ɛ sala mɔ de tom pɛ kongapora, nɛ mbwa pena nɛ wi. Mɛgi, ɛ hea mbela mbongaa ha zang kin, ha le Suze.<verse eid="EST 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 8:15" />Mardose daka tɛ wa ha lî kongapora, nɛ hio la konga, ka dafua nɛ̂ harahɔrɔ hinɛ bua, banɛ ma gasa latɛ ka dung nɛ bua hinɛ gbɛa. A yola fin ha zu wa ma gasa ndutu mɔ ɔr. le mɔ Suze dungɔ ha gdɔra nɛ totɛ. <verse eid="EST 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 8:16" />Hio Zuif dungɔ ha zang ma gasa gdɔra mɔ totɛ, nɛ mbwa dungɔ nɛ zio ha lî hio wi. <verse eid="EST 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 8:17" />Ha kandɔnu ndang ndang, ha le ndang ndang, ha bhandi fɛt ka haanû hinɛ mbonga pɛ kongapora hɔa ang, yo dungɔ nɛ̂ hio gasa yɔngamɔ nɛ yenga pɛ hio Zuif. Nɛ mbwa dungɔ ha zang gasa gdɔra mɔ totɛ. Dɔka wi dea tɛ mbwa tuka hio Zuif, ha soko hio olo kandɔ, hazu gasa ke pɛ hio Zuif baa mbwa.<verse eid="EST 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EST 9" />
  <para style="s1">Hio Zuif gbɛa hio ngana pɛ mbwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 9:1" />Yala bhukɔ gbala tar mɔ bhukɔ gbala bwa ze ka dung nɛ̂ ze mɔ Adar, nɛ yala bhukɔ gbala tar mɔ zea, yone yala ka ɛ weka mɔ de tom lɛm nɛ haa nû nɛ mbonga pɛ kongapora hɔa. Dungɔ nɛ̂ yala ka hio ngana pɛ hio Zuif gdea tazu mbwa ang mɔ dung wan hazu mbwa, nɛ wal mɔa tɛ bo fin nɛtɛ. Yo tɛ bo nɛ̂ hio Zuif ha dung wan hazu hio ngana pɛ mbwa. <verse eid="EST 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 9:2" />Ha zang hio le mɔ hio kandɔnu fɛt pɛ kongapora Assierus, hio Zuif wesara may hazu bi bulo sungiri nɛ hio wi ndɔng ka ki wal mɔ de gdangamɔ ha tɛ mbwa. Ma wi mɔ yol ha lî mbwa bo na, hazu gasa ke pɛ hio Zuif baa hio olo kandɔ fɛt. <verse eid="EST 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 9:3" />Hio wi mɔ si wa fɛt mɔ hio kandɔnu, hio kɔmanda, hio gasa wi mɔ gɔvɔrɔma, hinɛ hio wantom pɛ kongapora haa kɔ̂ ha hio Zuif, hazu gasa ke pɛ Mardose baa mbwa. <verse eid="EST 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 9:4" />Mɛgi, Mardose tɛ bo nɛ̂ gasa wi ha zang kin pɛ kongapora. Ling tɛ wa baa bhandi ha zang hio kandɔnu fɛt, nɛ sulotɛ pɛ Mardose ha kpɔa tɛ nɛ̂ nɛ̂.<verse eid="EST 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 9:5" />Tuka ɛngi, hio Zuif gbɛa hio ngana pɛ mbwa fɛt nɛ gbapa, mbwa bhondasa mbwa nɛ mbwa dea mɔ ha tɛ hio ngana tuka sila mbwa ngoya. <verse eid="EST 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 9:6" />Sɔna ha le Suze, hio Zuif gbɛa, nɛ karsi hio wi gɔmmay mɔrkɔ. <verse eid="EST 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 9:7" />Nɛ ɛ gbɛa: Parsandata, Dalfon, Aspata, <verse eid="EST 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 9:8" />Porata, Adalia, Aridata, <verse eid="EST 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 9:9" />Parmaseta, Arisai, Aridai hinɛ Vayezata. <verse eid="EST 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 9:10" />Hio bewei bhukɔ pɛ Haman, bewei pɛ Hamedata, ngana pɛ hio Zuif. Ha hio wi mɔ ndɔng fɛt, ɛ kay hio wi mɔ pɛ mbwa nɛ ngambanzi na.<verse eid="EST 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 9:11" />Ha ndangtɛ swe ɛngi, wen dɔka hio wi ka ɛ gbɛa ha le Suze hɔa ha pɛ kongapora. <verse eid="EST 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 9:12" />Kongapora tɔa ha ko pɛa Esther atɔa: «Kanɛ ha zang le Suze Sɔna, hio Zuif gbɛa nɛ karsi hio wi gɔmmay mɔrkɔ, nɛ hio bewei bhukɔ pɛ Haman. Ka mbwa dea mɛgi hakɛ, ngetɛ mɔ ha behɔ ha zang hio olo kandɔnu pɛ kongapora nde? Maa, anamɔ pɛ mɛ nɛ̂ ge? Ɛ behaa yo ha mɛ. Mɔ ka mɛ ngoya fin nɛ̂ ge? Ɛ bede yo ha mɛ.» <verse eid="EST 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 9:13" />Esther kiforo wen: «Ka kongapora ngoya, nɛ wal mbonga pɛa wɛnɛ haa wal ha hio Zuif mɔ Suze mɔ de mɛgi bhisiri tuka mɛsɛ, nɛ ɛ gɛsi hio bewei bhukɔ pɛ Haman ha te. <verse eid="EST 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 9:14" />Kongapora haa nû mɔ de yo tuka ɛngi. Ɛ gbasa mbongaa ha Suze nɛ ɛ gɛsa hio bewei pɛ Haman bhukɔ. <verse eid="EST 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 9:15" />Mɛgi, hio Zuif mɔ Suze wesara may fin ha yala bhukɔ gbala nar mɔ ze Adar, nɛ mbwa gbɛa hio wi gɔmmay tar, maa, mbwa tɛ kay hio wi mɔ pɛ hio wi nɛ ngambanzi na.<verse eid="EST 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 9:16" />Hio olo Zuif, ɛ ndɔng mɔ hio kandɔnu pɛ kongapora wesara may hazu pamtɛ mbwa sungiri nɛ hio ngana pɛ mbwa. Hio Zuif gbɛa hio ngana pɛ mbwa tomay bhukɔa mɔrkɔ zubhuzebwa zanga mɔrkɔ (75 000), nɛ mbwa tɛ̂ kay hio wi mɔ nɛ ngambanzi na, <verse eid="EST 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 9:17" />ha yala bhukɔ gbala tar mɔ ze Adar, ha yala bhukɔ gbala nar, mbwa ɔma tɛ mbwa nɛ mbwa weka yala ɛngi tuka yala gasa yɔngamɔ hinɛ yala totɛ. <verse eid="EST 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 9:18" />Ka bonɛ̂ pɛ hio Zuif mɔ Suze, mbwa wesara may ha yala bhukɔ gbala tar hinɛ yala bhukɔ gbala nar, mbwa ɔma tɛ ha yala bhukɔ zanga mɔrkɔ. Mbwa gdea swea tuka yala mɔ gasa yɔngamɔ hinɛ mɔ totɛ. <verse eid="EST 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 9:19" />Yo nɛ̂ ɛngi, hio Zuif ka ɔ ha hio bebe le, mbwa gdea yala bhukɔ gbala nar mɔ Adar nɛ yala totɛ, yala gasa yɔngamɔ, hinɛ yala yenga ka wi ndang ndang ha haa kado ha may.<verse eid="EST 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yenga mɔ purim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 9:20" />Mardose ngɛraka hio wi mɔ ndɔng fɛt ha zang takarata, nɛ a tomsa yo ha hio Zuif fɛt mɔ hio kandɔnu fɛt pɛ kongapora Assierus, ka dung sanga mana nɛ nyɛa. <verse eid="EST 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 9:21" />Wɛnɛ haa nû nde mbwa ade mɔ lɛm nɛ mbonga mɔ yala bhukɔ gbala nar mɔsoykisi nɛ yala bhukɔ zanga mɔrkɔ mɔ ze Adar, mɔ bɛlɛ ndang ndang. <verse eid="EST 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 9:22" />Tuka hio yala ndɔng ka hio Zuif dungɔ ha pama tɛ mbwa sungiri nɛ hio ngana pɛ mbwa, ha ze ɛngi, ngɔtɛ pɛ mbwa kiforo nɛ totɛ, nɛ zimɔmɔ pɛ mbwa kiforo nɛ yenga. Lɛma nde mbwa ade yo tuka yala gasa yɔngamɔ hinɛ yala totɛ ha zang bɛlɛ ndang ndang. Hio wi atomsi hio kado ha may, nɛ hio wi mɔkɔ̂ ha hio fabha wi. <verse eid="EST 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 9:23" />Hio Zuif dea mɔ lɛm nɛ haa nû pɛ Mardose, nɛ mbwa baa bosi dea yenga ɛngɛ tuka ndɔki deamɔ pɛ mbwa.<verse eid="EST 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EST 9:24" />Haman, bewei pɛ Hamedata mɔ pɛlnam pɛ Agag, ngana pɛ hio Zuif, dungɔ nɛ takaramɔ mɔ bhondisi hio Zuif. Wɛnɛ gɔsa purim, ka dung tuka zeke mɔ ki nɛ gotomɔ ka de mbwa yembele, nɛ karsi mbwa. <verse eid="EST 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EST 9:25" />Maa, ka Esther nɛ̂a ha lî kongapora, nɛ a haa nû nɛ wal ngɛrikamɔ nde: Gdangamɔ ka Haman babhɔngiri sungiri nɛ hio Zuif atek hazu wa, nɛ ɛ gɛsi wɛnɛ ha te mɔsoykisi hinɛ hio bewei pɛa. <verse eid="EST 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EST 9:26" />Yo nɛ̂ ɛngi, ka ɛ saa hio swe ndɔng nde: Purim nɛ wal ling pur<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pur: Yo dung tuka zeke. Zɔk Esther 3.7.</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 9:26">Mɛgi, nɛ wal hio wi mɔ ndɔng fɛt ka hio takarata ɛngi ngɛrka wena, nɛ hio wi mɔ ka mbwa zɔka ha zanga, nɛ mɔ ka hɔa ha tɛ mbwa. <verse eid="EST 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EST 9:27" />Hio Zuif gdea ma ndɔki deamɔ, ka hio bezang mbwa, nɛ hio wi ndɔng ka bede tɛ mbwa tuka hio Zuif lɛm kafi yo na: Ɛ bede yenga mɔ hio yala bwa ndɔng nɛ wal mɔ ka ɛ ngɛraka, hinɛ ngimɔ ka ɛ osa mɔ bɛlɛ ndang ndang. <verse eid="EST 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EST 9:28" />Ɛ begba tazu nɛ dea yenga mɔ hio yala ndɔng, tanga nɛ tanga, ha zang nam ndang ndang, ha zang kandɔnu ndang ndang, ha zang le ndang ndang. Ɛ lɛm kafi hio yala mɔ purim ndɔng ha pɛ hio Zuif na, nɛ tazu hio bezang mbwa lɛm bisi nɛ yo na.<verse eid="EST 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EST 9:29" />Esther, ko pɛ kongapora, bebhoko pɛ Abisail, hinɛ Zuif Mardose ngɛraka zebwa takarata mɔ ha ngaya ha takarata mɔ purim. <verse eid="EST 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EST 9:30" />Haa hio Zuif fɛt mɔ hio kandɔ nu gɔmmay ndang zubhuzebwa zanga mɔrkɔ gbala bwa (127) mɔ kongakandɔ nu pɛ Assierus, ɛ tomsa hio takarata mɔ hio wen gaamɔ, hinɛ mɔ mboazu. <verse eid="EST 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EST 9:31" />Ɛ gde hio swe mɔ purim ndɔng anu ha yala pɛ mbwa ka Mardose hinɛ Esther, ko pɛ kongapora haa nɛ nû, mɔsoykisi tuka hio ngimɔ zimɔmɔ nɛ tɔatɛ ka mbwa bagde anu hazu hio Zuif nɛ tɛ mbwa, nɛ pɛ hio bezang mbwa. <verse eid="EST 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EST 9:32" />Haa nu pɛ Esther ka wɛnɛ gdea anu ha yenga mɔ purim. Yo nɛ̂ ɛngi, ɛ ngɛraka yo ha zang takarata ɛngɛ.<verse eid="EST 9:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EST 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kongapora Assierus hinɛ Mardose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 10:1" />Kongapora Assierus haa nû ha hio wi mɔ le pɛa, hinɛ hio wi ka dung ha zang hio kisi mɔ nana-litɔng mɔ kpe garama. <verse eid="EST 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 10:2" />Kasiwen mɔ ziomɔ hinɛ mɔ da pɛa, hinɛ hio bebe wen ha zu guo Mardose ha ngɔn ka kongapora guo, ɛ ngɛraka yo fɛt ha takarata mɔ hio deamɔ pɛ hio kongapora mɔ Medi hinɛ mɔ Perse. <verse eid="EST 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 10:3" />Hazu Zuif Mardose dungɔ tɛ bonɛ bosi gasa wantom mɔ gɔvɔrɔma pɛ kongapora Assierus, gasawi pɛ hio Zuif, ka hio ya wa fɛt ngoya. Wɛnɛ ba de tom nɛ dedea hazu pama dede dungɔ nu pɛ hio kandɔ pɛa.<verse eid="EST 10:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 10" />
</usx>